WEBVTT

01:18.770 --> 01:21.960
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.920
[Episode 7]

01:25.070 --> 01:26.780
Well then, President Li
we'll get started.

01:26.780 --> 01:27.310
Alright.

01:27.640 --> 01:28.700
Let's get started.

01:30.789 --> 01:32.300
As of the end of the second quarter,

01:32.300 --> 01:34.900
the Shanlifang Hotel Group network

01:35.070 --> 01:37.509
comprises 130 operating hotels

01:35.890 --> 01:37.520
[Market Share of Shanlifang Hotel Group]

01:37.550 --> 01:38.660
[Operating Performance
of Shanlifang Hotel Group]

01:37.759 --> 01:39.229
with over 30,000 guest rooms,

01:39.229 --> 01:41.950
spanning 53 prefecture-level cities
and regions

01:41.950 --> 01:44.890
across 24 provinces, municipalities,
and autonomous regions nationwide.

01:44.890 --> 01:48.450
[Landlord, the director used your report.
You might be able to return to work.]

01:45.870 --> 01:46.560
In addition,

01:46.560 --> 01:48.910
there are 120 hotels in the pipeline
awaiting opening,

01:48.910 --> 01:52.920
all of which are expected to commence
operations within the next 5 years.

01:52.920 --> 01:53.900
Of course,

01:54.000 --> 01:55.560
these promising prospects

01:55.960 --> 01:59.060
[You're here?]

01:56.150 --> 01:58.320
point toward capital's pursuit
of returns,

01:58.320 --> 01:59.780
while our responsibility

02:00.150 --> 02:02.280
is to ensure they are delivered perfectly.

02:01.380 --> 02:02.620
[I'm in the conference room. Guess you owe
your mentor an extra dish tonight.]

02:06.860 --> 02:07.930
[Don't flatter yourself. That chapter
with the mentor is already over.]

02:07.960 --> 02:09.139
[But you can order whatever you want.
So, what do you feel like eating?]

02:11.120 --> 02:13.000
Let's wrap it up for today.

02:15.430 --> 02:17.590
For future work convenience,

02:17.610 --> 02:19.070
we've drafted

02:19.100 --> 02:21.240
a responsibility
and authority allocation agreement

02:21.240 --> 02:23.840
to clarify

02:23.870 --> 02:26.820
our respective scopes of work
and responsibilities.

02:26.820 --> 02:28.220
Please have a look first.

02:37.320 --> 02:38.170
President Li,

02:39.079 --> 02:40.560
are you feeling a bit off today?

02:40.560 --> 02:41.150
Yes, sorry about that.

02:41.150 --> 02:42.950
My stomach is a bit upset.

02:43.030 --> 02:43.870
Well, Zhao De,

02:43.930 --> 02:46.460
please have the legal team
review this later.

02:46.500 --> 02:48.960
We'll discuss it again after that,
alright?

02:49.460 --> 02:52.060
I'll step away to use the restroom
for a moment.

02:58.240 --> 03:01.320
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

03:03.870 --> 03:04.890
Are you done with the meeting?

03:04.890 --> 03:06.070
What are you doing here?

03:06.070 --> 03:07.330
Oh no—there's no time.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.080
Where's the restroom here?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.280
Turn left.

03:26.280 --> 03:27.000
Boss.

03:27.840 --> 03:28.520
Boss.

03:28.710 --> 03:29.910
Don't shout.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.420
I'm right here. The one in the middle.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.290
Are you alright, Boss?

03:38.360 --> 03:39.560
Is anyone around?

03:47.280 --> 03:47.970
No.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.230
Did you notice anything off

03:51.970 --> 03:53.410
about that agreement?

03:54.800 --> 03:55.960
I did.

03:56.220 --> 03:57.750
That's what's been bothering me too.

03:57.750 --> 03:58.800
Why did Fang Yun

03:58.820 --> 04:01.860
suddenly push this responsibility
and authority allocation agreement?

04:01.860 --> 04:02.860
What's the catch?

04:04.920 --> 04:06.680
I messed up my move.

04:08.070 --> 04:09.440
The original plan

04:09.630 --> 04:11.360
was for Qian Fei to lay all the problems
of Shanlifang

04:11.360 --> 04:12.720
out in front of Fang Yun,

04:12.750 --> 04:14.870
so she couldn't keep playing dumb—

04:16.120 --> 04:18.140
but I didn't expect Fang Yun
to react so quickly

04:18.140 --> 04:19.870
and shift the blame in advance.

04:21.579 --> 04:23.750
Qian Fei is your "gun," isn't she, Boss?

04:23.750 --> 04:24.720
Exactly.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.740
I almost backfired on myself.

04:30.100 --> 04:31.960
What did you eat last night, Boss…

04:32.240 --> 04:33.630
So, what do we do now?

04:34.430 --> 04:36.610
Do we sign this agreement or not?

04:36.750 --> 04:38.440
Are you out of your mind?

04:38.760 --> 04:40.220
Of course we can't sign it.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.240
Once we do,

04:41.270 --> 04:42.720
if Shanlifang goes public in the future

04:42.720 --> 04:43.940
and any financial issues come up,

04:43.940 --> 04:46.340
the responsibility will fall on Zhizhong.

04:47.710 --> 04:50.200
Fang Yun is truly cunning, isn't she?

04:51.510 --> 04:53.310
And all my efforts
to get my "little gun" reinstated

04:53.310 --> 04:54.480
will go to waste.

04:56.000 --> 04:58.800
Then this has nothing to do
with us anymore, right?

04:58.820 --> 05:00.020
Nothing to do with us?

05:00.720 --> 05:03.120
Qian Fei isn't someone
who gives up easily.

05:04.830 --> 05:06.040
She might—

05:06.240 --> 05:08.440
she might even track it down to Chengdu.

05:09.520 --> 05:10.950
T-To Chengdu?

05:12.000 --> 05:15.060
Shanlifang only entered East China
in the past 3 years.

05:15.160 --> 05:16.680
The original data from before that

05:16.680 --> 05:18.680
is in their headquarters—Chengdu.

05:18.770 --> 05:21.500
Looks like I'll have to
make a trip to Chengdu too.

05:22.270 --> 05:25.480
Boss, we're dealing
with Fang Yun right now,

05:25.500 --> 05:26.720
not Shanlifang.

05:26.980 --> 05:29.390
Shanlifang is the root of everything.

05:29.680 --> 05:31.250
Only by getting the original data

05:31.250 --> 05:32.860
do we have real leverage.

05:32.909 --> 05:34.870
You don't need to go personally.

05:35.120 --> 05:37.000
I can just send an intern.

05:37.800 --> 05:40.200
Those records are definitely buried deep.

05:40.360 --> 05:42.850
How could an intern find them?

05:44.950 --> 05:46.080
And I'm also worried

05:48.350 --> 05:50.150
Qian Fei might run into trouble—

05:50.380 --> 05:51.460
I need to help her.

05:53.730 --> 05:54.840
You're doing this for…

05:54.840 --> 05:56.320
For our project!

05:59.240 --> 06:00.370
Too many questions.

06:00.680 --> 06:02.240
Fine, I'm done dealing with them.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.720
Y-You just tell them

06:03.720 --> 06:05.130
I'm not feeling well and left.

06:05.130 --> 06:06.460
You stay and stall them.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.380
No problem.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.720
I'm an expert at stalling.

06:12.600 --> 06:15.460
Don't forget to bring toilet paper
to the bathroom.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.680
Zhao De?

06:30.480 --> 06:31.630
That was over so quickly?

06:31.630 --> 06:32.950
After our legal team reviewed it…

06:32.950 --> 06:34.580
The meeting has already been adjourned,
and Li Yifei still hasn't come back.

06:34.580 --> 06:35.990
It's fine, no rush.

06:36.620 --> 06:38.350
Thanks for coming all this way.

06:38.680 --> 06:39.340
No problem.

06:39.350 --> 06:40.480
I won't walk you out.

06:40.870 --> 06:41.510
Goodbye.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.040
Director Fang,
you were looking for me?

06:48.040 --> 06:49.040
Come to my office.

06:52.950 --> 06:54.570
I'm sure you know

06:55.310 --> 06:56.630
that some of the data

06:57.170 --> 06:58.140
from the report you prepared

06:58.140 --> 06:59.550
was used in today's meeting.

06:59.550 --> 07:00.830
Your work wasn't in vain—

07:00.830 --> 07:02.590
I'll make sure you receive a bonus for it.

07:02.590 --> 07:03.540
No need.

07:03.720 --> 07:05.270
I didn't do it for a bonus.

07:05.690 --> 07:06.920
Was it for reinstatement?

07:06.920 --> 07:07.920
To get into Shanlifang's

07:07.920 --> 07:08.920
IPO project team?

07:09.550 --> 07:10.300
Yes.

07:10.720 --> 07:13.100
Director Fang, I prepared
that research report for 2 reasons:

07:13.100 --> 07:15.510
first, to demonstrate
my personal capability;

07:15.510 --> 07:17.000
second, to show the value

07:17.070 --> 07:19.410
I can bring to the company.

07:19.560 --> 07:20.480
I know I may

07:20.500 --> 07:22.390
have missed
a lot of opportunities before,

07:22.390 --> 07:23.610
but I can assure you

07:23.630 --> 07:24.910
that in future work,

07:25.160 --> 07:25.720
I will definitely...

07:25.720 --> 07:26.980
Don't misunderstand.

07:28.160 --> 07:29.390
Using your research report

07:29.390 --> 07:30.330
doesn't mean
I'm bringing you onto the team.

07:30.330 --> 07:32.750
It's true your research report
saved me a lot of effort,

07:32.750 --> 07:34.409
but take a look at it yourself—

07:35.080 --> 07:36.360
it's full of second-hand data.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.920
Do you really think I can solve problems

07:37.920 --> 07:39.680
using second-hand data like this?

07:39.680 --> 07:42.409
Am I supposed to skip
field research altogether?

07:46.390 --> 07:49.310
You've probably been stuck
in the back office for too long.

07:49.310 --> 07:52.170
You're still not qualified
to join my project team.

08:05.510 --> 08:08.110
Opportunities are for those
who are prepared.

08:09.830 --> 08:10.640
That's it.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.040
You may leave now.

08:18.220 --> 08:18.910
Alright,

08:19.960 --> 08:21.420
thank you, Director Fang.

08:21.600 --> 08:23.000
Goodbye, Director Fang.

08:27.460 --> 08:29.120
[Marketing Director's Office]

08:38.460 --> 08:40.289
Don't get discouraged.

08:40.340 --> 08:41.400
Have a cup of coffee—

08:41.400 --> 08:43.059
it might help you feel better.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.580
Who said I'm discouraged?

08:45.160 --> 08:46.300
Then what's this...

08:47.120 --> 08:48.340
I'm thinking things through.

08:48.340 --> 08:49.570
Director Fang

08:49.720 --> 08:52.380
said I didn't demonstrate
my research ability,

08:52.730 --> 08:53.930
so I'll show it to her.

08:54.150 --> 08:55.550
Nothing wrong with working hard—

08:55.550 --> 08:57.410
just keep your emotions in check.

08:57.670 --> 08:59.390
I know exactly what I'm doing.

08:59.850 --> 09:01.360
I originally thought

09:01.630 --> 09:02.960
I could save my trump card

09:02.960 --> 09:05.090
until after joining the project team,

09:05.710 --> 09:06.840
but now it looks like

09:07.150 --> 09:09.840
I have to make a move immediately—
right away.

09:11.510 --> 09:12.080
No—wait,

09:12.750 --> 09:14.080
what are you going to do?

09:14.550 --> 09:15.410
I'm going home.

09:16.360 --> 09:18.550
Just wait and see. Bye.

09:31.240 --> 09:33.400
Without Shanlifang's authorization,

09:33.400 --> 09:36.260
I don't have the right
to conduct on-site research.

09:37.390 --> 09:39.070
In that case,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.750
I'll have to get the original data.

09:43.440 --> 09:44.720
But anyone who was later

09:44.720 --> 09:46.780
suspected of tampering with the data

09:47.350 --> 09:48.780
would have destroyed it—

09:48.810 --> 09:50.540
why would they keep it instead?

09:52.870 --> 09:54.080
Unless the employee responsible

09:54.080 --> 09:56.200
for the internal audit
of Shanlifang's Chengdu headquarters

09:56.200 --> 09:58.930
financial statements back then
was smart enough

09:59.080 --> 10:00.830
to protect himself...

10:02.440 --> 10:03.840
Yes. It could only be him.

10:06.040 --> 10:09.050
But he must have been
a core member of the finance department—

10:09.050 --> 10:11.780
why would he ever
hand those materials over to me?

10:12.910 --> 10:14.940
Never mind. I'll find him first,

10:15.030 --> 10:16.830
and then handle it accordingly.

10:25.090 --> 10:26.430
A limited edition?

10:26.930 --> 10:27.810
That's right.

10:28.840 --> 10:30.550
I know you like golf, Uncle Liao,

10:30.550 --> 10:30.910
so

10:30.910 --> 10:33.180
I had a friend overseas help me find one—
it took quite some time

10:33.180 --> 10:34.910
before I finally got it for you.

10:35.000 --> 10:37.060
It took quite a bit of effort to get it.

10:38.030 --> 10:38.720
I like it.

10:39.570 --> 10:40.230
Glad you do.

10:42.150 --> 10:42.790
Kid,

10:44.380 --> 10:46.230
last time we met,

10:46.390 --> 10:48.850
you were still calling me
Chairman Liao every other sentence.

10:48.850 --> 10:51.720
This time,
it's not about business anymore?

10:51.790 --> 10:53.160
Of course not.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.930
Your birthday is coming up
in a few days.

10:54.930 --> 10:56.940
As a junior, I should definitely
show some appreciation,

10:56.940 --> 10:57.490
right?

10:59.630 --> 11:01.910
You may just give birthday gifts
on the day itself.

11:01.910 --> 11:03.480
Isn't this a bit too early?

11:04.790 --> 11:05.890
Actually, I was just about to tell you—

11:05.890 --> 11:07.750
I'm heading to Chengdu tomorrow.

11:07.910 --> 11:09.510
I was worried

11:09.550 --> 11:12.120
I might not make it back in time
for your birthday banquet.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.250
Heading to Chengdu?

11:15.390 --> 11:16.440
You're the person in charge

11:16.440 --> 11:18.220
of our IPO project right now.

11:18.360 --> 11:20.250
How can you leave on a business trip
at a time like this?

11:20.250 --> 11:25.290
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

11:20.390 --> 11:22.050
Here's the thing, Uncle Liao.

11:22.480 --> 11:24.620
There's a small
international academic salon

11:24.620 --> 11:25.880
being held in Chengdu.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.640
One of my professors has been invited,

11:27.640 --> 11:29.500
and he just asked me to go with him.

11:29.670 --> 11:31.320
I thought it might be a good opportunity

11:31.320 --> 11:32.120
to introduce

11:32.140 --> 11:33.570
Shanlifang at the salon.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.360
Even though there's no media coverage,

11:35.360 --> 11:37.150
it could still help build up momentum

11:37.150 --> 11:39.360
for Shanlifang's IPO
at an academic level,

11:39.360 --> 11:40.100
so I agreed.

11:41.650 --> 11:44.650
No media coverage,
and it can still build up momentum?

11:44.960 --> 11:46.610
These finance scholars

11:46.640 --> 11:48.450
are all top figures in the industry.

11:48.450 --> 11:49.820
You know how it works.

11:52.390 --> 11:52.960
Alright.

11:54.240 --> 11:56.900
It's rare that you have
this kind of initiative.

11:57.840 --> 11:58.510
Yifei,

11:59.270 --> 12:00.600
if you need any support,

12:00.960 --> 12:02.120
just say the word.

12:05.120 --> 12:06.920
Support isn't really the issue.

12:08.240 --> 12:09.440
I do have one concern.

12:12.410 --> 12:13.910
Don't beat around the bush.

12:13.910 --> 12:15.100
Just say it.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.640
Alright, I'll be direct.

12:17.550 --> 12:20.500
Since it's an academic salon,

12:21.030 --> 12:23.430
the level of attention
will be quite broad.

12:23.610 --> 12:26.550
But the data I currently have

12:26.670 --> 12:28.420
isn't sufficient to support my argument.

12:28.420 --> 12:29.350
If I could

12:29.600 --> 12:30.640
include data

12:30.660 --> 12:33.530
from Shanlifang's Chengdu partners
from 3 years ago as supporting evidence,

12:33.530 --> 12:35.460
that would make a huge difference.

12:48.770 --> 12:50.170
So what you're saying is,

12:51.130 --> 12:52.590
you need my authorization

12:53.360 --> 12:54.490
to go to Chengdu

12:55.080 --> 12:57.720
and communicate with those partners
on behalf of Shanlifang.

12:57.720 --> 12:58.520
Is that right?

13:00.080 --> 13:00.510
Yes.

13:00.550 --> 13:02.940
If you're willing to authorize me,

13:03.200 --> 13:04.840
of course it would be more effective—

13:04.840 --> 13:06.700
but if you're concerned about it…

13:07.440 --> 13:08.570
that's fine too.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.500
I-It's really not a big issue.

13:12.960 --> 13:15.530
The way you put it—I'm concerned?
Why would I be?

13:15.530 --> 13:16.990
It's just authorization.

13:17.510 --> 13:20.040
I'll have my secretary
prepare it right away.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.490
Yifei,

13:22.460 --> 13:23.490
not just that,

13:25.120 --> 13:28.850
I'll give you the contact information
for all the partners as well.

13:28.910 --> 13:29.630
Kid,

13:30.340 --> 13:32.960
go ahead and swing that club freely.

13:33.390 --> 13:34.960
That's great, Uncle Liao.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.630
Thank you, Chairman Liao.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.630
There you go again.

13:37.630 --> 13:38.630
Didn't we agree?

13:38.650 --> 13:39.870
In private, call me Uncle Liao.

13:39.870 --> 13:41.930
Right, right. Thank you, Uncle Liao.

13:42.280 --> 13:43.600
[Corporate News]

13:46.000 --> 13:48.200
These finance-related
corporate news pieces

13:48.200 --> 13:51.250
should have been written by a professional
from the finance department.

13:51.250 --> 13:53.310
So why isn't there a single name on it?

13:56.490 --> 13:56.580
[Corporate Culture]

13:56.640 --> 13:59.320
[Empowering the Future, Grateful for You—
2018 Company Annual Gala]

13:59.320 --> 14:01.120
[Shanlifang Hotel Group Annual
Outstanding Employee Award Certificate]

14:05.200 --> 14:06.200
The annual gala?

14:06.550 --> 14:08.600
The one from 3 years ago?

14:11.100 --> 14:14.730
[Outstanding Employee of the Year—
Finance Department: Xin You]

14:35.550 --> 14:37.950
If I take a flight,
it'll be more efficient.

14:38.830 --> 14:39.990
For the return trip,

14:40.790 --> 14:43.120
I'll take a hard-seat ticket
to save some money—

14:43.120 --> 14:44.260
might as well get some writing done
on the way.

14:44.260 --> 14:44.620
[From Shanghai to Chengdu]

14:44.640 --> 14:44.930
[Loading...]

14:44.960 --> 14:45.530
[From Shanghai to Chengdu]

14:45.560 --> 14:46.360
[From Shanghai to Chengdu]
[Passenger Information]

14:52.170 --> 14:53.810
[From Chengdu to Shanghai] [Hard seat]

14:56.870 --> 14:58.150
[Mulian Hotel, Chengdu Global Center]

14:58.180 --> 14:59.150
[Chengdu Xinliang Hotel]

15:01.150 --> 15:01.920
But…

15:02.030 --> 15:04.230
why is the accommodation so expensive?

15:12.710 --> 15:14.440
My dad's birthday is next week—

15:14.790 --> 15:16.450
we're having a small banquet,

15:16.600 --> 15:17.730
you should come too.

15:18.470 --> 15:19.130
Sure.

15:19.790 --> 15:21.560
Why don't you look surprised at all?

15:21.560 --> 15:22.590
You already knew?

15:23.540 --> 15:24.450
As an employee,

15:24.480 --> 15:26.700
of course I know
the chairman's birthday is coming up.

15:26.700 --> 15:28.200
I've even prepared a gift for him.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.330
What did you get him?

15:29.790 --> 15:31.920
I bought him some health supplements.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.200
Health supplements?

15:33.720 --> 15:35.850
My dad hates it
when people give him those.

15:35.850 --> 15:39.580
It's basically like telling him
he's getting old right to his face.

15:40.190 --> 15:41.450
Then what does he like?

15:41.960 --> 15:43.330
You don't need to worry about that.

15:43.330 --> 15:44.230
I'll handle it.

15:45.280 --> 15:46.410
Is that really appropriate?

15:46.410 --> 15:47.960
What's inappropriate about it?

15:47.960 --> 15:49.890
Look at you—you've gotten so thin.

15:49.960 --> 15:51.480
You're working overtime every day;

15:51.480 --> 15:52.880
it's hard to even see you.

15:54.550 --> 15:56.810
I've only just taken over things at work.

15:57.240 --> 15:59.500
There's still a lot
I haven't sorted out.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.510
Actually, you don't need

16:03.080 --> 16:04.880
to push yourself so hard at work.

16:06.600 --> 16:08.510
You just need to do one thing well—

16:08.840 --> 16:10.080
be with me properly.

16:33.080 --> 16:35.240
Li Yifei, I'm going out for a while.

16:35.240 --> 16:36.630
I'll be back in a week at most.

16:36.630 --> 16:38.030
Don't make too much of a mess at home.

16:38.030 --> 16:38.960
If you're not going to cook,

16:38.960 --> 16:40.670
remember to turn off the gas.

16:41.790 --> 16:43.120
What are you going to do?

16:43.360 --> 16:44.560
Just to clear my head.

17:10.839 --> 17:12.369
Miss, please move aside.

17:14.450 --> 17:15.030
You?

17:15.640 --> 17:16.310
What are you doing here?

17:16.310 --> 17:17.510
Weren't you still asleep?

17:17.510 --> 17:19.440
I'm going on a business trip today.

17:20.210 --> 17:21.859
You're going to Chengdu too?

17:24.069 --> 17:26.869
Oh, so you were going to Chengdu
to clear your head.

17:27.990 --> 17:28.790
Yeah.

17:30.550 --> 17:31.910
What a coincidence.

17:32.790 --> 17:34.250
Can you move behind me now?

17:34.510 --> 17:35.510
Sorry,

17:35.590 --> 17:36.480
I'm in business class.

17:36.480 --> 17:39.160
I'm not even checking in
at the same counter as you.

17:39.160 --> 17:40.480
Then go to your business-class counter.

17:40.480 --> 17:41.720
What are you doing here?

17:41.720 --> 17:42.510
I thought I could

17:42.510 --> 17:43.820
have you pretend to be my secretary

17:43.820 --> 17:45.640
and take you into business class.

17:45.640 --> 17:46.810
Pretend to be your secretary?

17:46.810 --> 17:48.480
Are you crazy, or am I?

17:50.920 --> 17:52.160
What are you really going to Chengdu for?

17:52.160 --> 17:54.560
Are you trying to investigate Shanlifang?

17:57.120 --> 17:58.740
You want to come with me?

18:00.960 --> 18:02.980
Why would I want to go with you?

18:04.350 --> 18:06.350
I'm not even on your project team.

18:10.640 --> 18:12.000
The reason you're going to Chengdu

18:12.000 --> 18:13.500
is because you saw

18:13.610 --> 18:15.200
the research report
I gave Director Fang.

18:15.200 --> 18:16.550
In it, you noticed there were issues
with Shanlifang's financial data

18:16.550 --> 18:18.880
from before the headquarters
moved to East China.

18:18.880 --> 18:19.480
That's why

18:19.480 --> 18:21.070
you're going to Chengdu—
to dig up the original data,

18:21.070 --> 18:21.970
right?

18:22.270 --> 18:23.750
If you hadn't seen my research report,

18:23.750 --> 18:25.110
you wouldn't have noticed anything wrong.

18:25.110 --> 18:26.770
So technically, I helped you.

18:27.450 --> 18:29.710
You really think too highly of yourself.

18:30.400 --> 18:33.030
I already knew there were issues
with Shanlifang.

18:33.030 --> 18:33.790
Besides,

18:34.270 --> 18:36.460
that research report of yours
was finished with my help—

18:36.460 --> 18:37.520
don't forget that.

18:39.130 --> 18:40.890
Even you realized issues...

18:41.590 --> 18:42.550
Then logically,

18:42.570 --> 18:45.160
Director Fang couldn't
have been unaware of them.

18:45.160 --> 18:45.640
But don't you think

18:45.640 --> 18:47.590
-the attitude Director Fang showed...
-Exactly.

18:47.590 --> 18:49.850
Don't you think her attitude is strange?

18:49.920 --> 18:50.510
Maybe that's something

18:50.510 --> 18:52.370
worth thinking about carefully.

18:53.550 --> 18:54.440
Alright, stop overthinking it.

18:54.440 --> 18:57.370
Come on, I'll take you
to the business class counter.

18:57.640 --> 18:59.060
Can you actually bring someone
into the business class?

18:59.060 --> 19:00.010
Of course.

19:00.240 --> 19:02.410
[Terminal 2]

19:05.070 --> 19:06.110
Alight, got it.

19:06.750 --> 19:07.790
Alright then.

19:10.000 --> 19:10.750
Come in.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.850
[Marketing Director's Office]

19:15.170 --> 19:16.080
Director Fang,

19:16.280 --> 19:17.880
Li Yifei has gone to Chengdu.

19:20.160 --> 19:23.620
He's heading straight
into Shanlifang's backyard, isn't he?

19:24.160 --> 19:26.620
Looks like
the push on him yesterday worked.

19:28.440 --> 19:29.920
You mean that agreement

19:29.940 --> 19:31.370
was meant to push him

19:31.470 --> 19:33.250
into investigating Shanlifang's accounts?

19:33.250 --> 19:39.730
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

19:34.030 --> 19:37.090
There are definitely issues
with Shanlifang's books.

19:37.480 --> 19:37.970
Look,

19:38.000 --> 19:40.510
if we're holding
onto these unclear financials,

19:40.510 --> 19:42.030
when things eventually blow up,

19:42.030 --> 19:42.980
as underwriters,

19:42.980 --> 19:44.580
won't we get dragged into it?

19:46.880 --> 19:48.220
But didn't you say

19:48.510 --> 19:50.440
we shouldn't interfere
with Qian Fei's research report anymore?

19:50.380 --> 19:54.110
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

19:50.460 --> 19:52.660
That we shouldn't keep investigating?

19:52.960 --> 19:54.620
Did I tell you to investigate?

19:55.310 --> 19:57.840
Did I tell anyone
from He Jing to investigate?

19:58.850 --> 20:01.310
What's the purpose
of falsifying accounts?

20:02.550 --> 20:04.000
To make money.

20:05.000 --> 20:06.570
If we go poking around their books,

20:06.570 --> 20:08.110
aren't we just cutting
off their revenue stream?

20:06.610 --> 20:10.040
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

20:10.110 --> 20:11.250
If

20:11.880 --> 20:13.950
Shanlifang's finances take a hit,

20:14.030 --> 20:16.690
do you think Liao Jinshan
will just let it slide?

20:17.440 --> 20:18.160
I see.

20:18.790 --> 20:21.030
If we don't investigate, we might end up
taking the blame later.

20:21.030 --> 20:23.030
But if we do investigate ourselves,

20:23.030 --> 20:24.470
we'll offend Shanlifang.

20:24.470 --> 20:26.060
So the best move

20:26.200 --> 20:27.440
is to have someone else

20:27.440 --> 20:28.910
stir up the hornet's nest for us.

20:28.910 --> 20:35.060
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

20:31.090 --> 20:32.290
And if because of this

20:33.480 --> 20:35.610
Zhizhong Investment gets pushed out,

20:37.050 --> 20:39.380
He Jing will become the sole underwriter.

20:41.400 --> 20:43.930
That's a three-birds-with-one-stone move.

20:45.640 --> 20:46.590
So what do we do

20:46.880 --> 20:47.980
next?

20:48.920 --> 20:50.120
We shall wait and see.

20:53.310 --> 20:53.920
Alright.

20:54.790 --> 20:55.580
I'll head out then.

20:55.580 --> 20:59.750
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

21:08.270 --> 21:09.130
Excuse me, Sir.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.860
Are you traveling alone?

21:12.590 --> 21:13.200
What is it?

21:13.320 --> 21:14.680
There's a gentleman

21:14.680 --> 21:16.310
who'd like to switch seats with you.

21:16.310 --> 21:18.550
His seat is
in the business class cabin—

21:18.550 --> 21:19.570
would that be alright?

21:19.570 --> 21:20.110
Sure.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.190
Alright.

21:27.240 --> 21:28.030
Thank you.

21:31.630 --> 21:31.990
[Shanlifang Hotel Financial Data]

21:40.620 --> 21:42.820
Why aren't you sitting
in your business class seat

21:42.820 --> 21:44.680
and instead came all the way
back to economy?

21:44.680 --> 21:46.540
Just came to see what you're up to.

21:47.520 --> 21:49.850
I was just looking
for a good show to watch.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.880
And? Did you find anything?

21:52.200 --> 21:52.930
Not yet.

21:53.330 --> 21:54.040
Alright.

21:57.400 --> 21:59.640
Hey—what are you doing?
Why are you plugging in a USB drive?

21:59.640 --> 22:02.050
Stop watching dramas.
You should actually study something.

22:02.040 --> 22:04.390
[Please enter your passcode
to unlock this drive]

22:03.440 --> 22:05.510
These are my personal notes

22:04.940 --> 22:05.200
[Private Notes]

22:05.510 --> 22:07.270
from all my projects over the years—

22:07.270 --> 22:08.470
study them properly.

22:09.720 --> 22:11.030
Trying to act all mature again.

22:11.030 --> 22:12.430
Fine, don't take it then.

22:12.640 --> 22:13.400
Don't move—

22:13.460 --> 22:15.120
finger-breaking technique.

22:15.770 --> 22:16.660
Immature.

22:18.520 --> 22:19.830
Let's see how capable you are.

22:19.830 --> 22:22.160
I don't even know
if you can understand it.

22:22.640 --> 22:24.440
I'll have you know,

22:24.440 --> 22:25.310
when it comes to studying,

22:25.310 --> 22:26.560
there's nothing I can't learn.

22:26.560 --> 22:29.090
Alright, alright, impressive, impressive.

22:31.660 --> 22:35.560
[Investment Banking Work Insights]

22:38.350 --> 22:40.810
This is practically
a secret treasure book.

22:43.750 --> 22:44.590
So tell me—

22:44.780 --> 22:46.240
what's the catch

22:46.240 --> 22:48.300
for giving me all this so generously?

22:56.550 --> 22:57.480
I get it—

22:57.670 --> 22:59.630
you want me to go with you

22:59.700 --> 23:01.160
to investigate
Shanlifang's early financial data

23:01.160 --> 23:03.030
once we land in Chengdu.

23:03.060 --> 23:04.390
You said that yourself.

23:04.390 --> 23:05.540
I didn't.

23:06.720 --> 23:07.850
But fine.

23:09.270 --> 23:11.160
Since you're so eager to come with me…

23:11.160 --> 23:11.690
I...

23:11.790 --> 23:12.830
Hey—I'm not.

23:12.850 --> 23:14.450
I'm going there on vacation.

23:18.350 --> 23:19.070
Alright, alright.

23:19.070 --> 23:21.070
When we get back,
I'll cook for you every day—

23:21.070 --> 23:23.130
stir-fried eggplant, braised pork.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.160
Look,

23:24.480 --> 23:26.480
I'll give you 2 hours to think about it.

23:26.480 --> 23:27.570
Once we land in Chengdu,

23:27.570 --> 23:28.700
tell me your answer.

23:30.490 --> 23:31.420
Study hard.

23:32.270 --> 23:34.160
I need to rest.

23:43.190 --> 23:44.620
Study properly.

23:46.970 --> 23:48.060
You scared me.

23:51.940 --> 23:53.920
The soup's here. The soup's here!

23:54.160 --> 23:55.790
Alright, alright,
stop playing on your phone.

23:55.790 --> 23:56.720
This is so fun.

23:56.720 --> 23:57.400
Let's eat.

23:57.400 --> 23:59.130
Just a second, I'm almost done.

23:59.690 --> 24:00.790
I—I don't really know how to play,

24:00.790 --> 24:02.020
but I saw the Chinese team win,

24:02.020 --> 24:03.220
and I got so excited.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.960
I'm totally fired up!

24:06.110 --> 24:07.260
Mom, don't get too excited.

24:07.260 --> 24:08.640
No matter how hard I play,

24:08.640 --> 24:09.940
I'm never going to win a championship.

24:09.940 --> 24:11.280
Don't put too much pressure on me.

24:11.280 --> 24:13.880
-Who's putting pressure on you? Seriously.
-No pressure.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.810
What pressure? Be more confident.

24:16.450 --> 24:18.070
And if you ever

24:18.100 --> 24:19.570
do become a champion one day,

24:19.570 --> 24:20.810
I'll be over the moon.

24:22.270 --> 24:24.440
From now on,

24:25.000 --> 24:25.720
I'm not

24:25.960 --> 24:26.960
against gaming anymore—

24:26.960 --> 24:27.690
I support it.

24:29.920 --> 24:31.790
Come on,

24:32.160 --> 24:33.550
have a drumstick—you need the energy.

24:33.550 --> 24:35.610
You've been training so hard lately.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.790
Have a drumstick—you need the energy.

24:37.790 --> 24:39.750
Dad, I haven't even
really started eating yet,

24:39.750 --> 24:41.550
but I'm already full of your PDA.

24:42.750 --> 24:43.750
You single guys

24:43.750 --> 24:45.640
should have the awareness of single guys.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.180
You can't even find a girlfriend,

24:47.180 --> 24:49.370
and you're still trying to stop me
and your mom from showing PDA?

24:49.370 --> 24:51.020
You can show it too.

24:51.200 --> 24:52.000
That's right.

24:52.030 --> 24:54.070
E-Except that you need
a girlfriend

24:54.070 --> 24:54.750
to show it with.

24:54.750 --> 24:56.440
You don't have anyone, so how are you
going to show affection?

24:56.440 --> 24:57.050
Exactly.

24:57.080 --> 24:57.900
Bring someone home

24:57.900 --> 24:59.010
and show us.

25:03.830 --> 25:04.830
Jun,

25:05.160 --> 25:06.240
you're already 30.

25:06.510 --> 25:07.200
Mom,

25:07.640 --> 25:09.270
I'm only 26.

25:09.440 --> 25:10.200
And what about your nominal age?

25:10.200 --> 25:11.640
Add two years—that makes you 28.

25:11.640 --> 25:12.550
Isn't that almost 30?

25:12.550 --> 25:13.270
Exactly,

25:13.550 --> 25:15.680
aren't you basically approaching 30?

25:19.590 --> 25:20.400
Oh, by the way,

25:21.200 --> 25:23.220
the daughter of my team leader—

25:23.270 --> 25:24.850
you should really take a look.

25:24.850 --> 25:26.160
-I'll show you her photo.
-Mom. Mom. Mom.

25:26.160 --> 25:27.100
Stop. Stop please.

25:27.100 --> 25:27.440
Why?

25:27.460 --> 25:29.480
Really, you don't need
to set me up anymore.

25:29.480 --> 25:30.990
To be honest with you,

25:31.530 --> 25:33.260
I already have someone in mind.

25:33.880 --> 25:34.990
Really?

25:36.350 --> 25:37.920
Of course it's true.

25:37.920 --> 25:39.270
What does she do?

25:39.310 --> 25:40.180
What kind of girl is she?

25:40.180 --> 25:41.470
Is she tall?

25:41.920 --> 25:43.810
What does her family do?

25:43.830 --> 25:45.740
Is she a Shanghai local,
or is she from out of town?

25:45.740 --> 25:46.710
Which university did she graduate from?

25:46.710 --> 25:47.740
Is it a 985 university?

25:47.740 --> 25:49.000
Or is it a 211 university?

25:49.000 --> 25:50.110
How did she do
on the college entrance exam?

25:50.110 --> 25:53.550
-I'm telling you, that matters a lot.
-Mom, Mom—I just remembered

25:53.550 --> 25:54.310
I've got something
at the neighborhood office.

25:54.310 --> 25:55.790
I need to go back and work overtime.

25:55.790 --> 25:58.790
-Explain yourself.
-Hey—what about her exam scores?

26:42.410 --> 26:43.870
Have you made up your mind?

26:44.310 --> 26:45.570
I'm going on vacation.

26:47.050 --> 26:48.780
Alright. Then have a good trip.

26:49.550 --> 26:50.350
Bye.

26:53.250 --> 26:55.450
Be careful out there when you're alone.

26:55.580 --> 26:56.400
Don't worry.

26:56.400 --> 26:58.600
If I run into any bad guys,
I'll call you.

26:59.850 --> 27:03.050
Could it be that Fang Yun
secretly assigned her some task?

27:03.050 --> 27:05.980
But that doesn't seem like
Fang Yun's usual style...

27:13.500 --> 27:16.730
[Cheng Dou Hao Qi Group Co., Ltd]

27:18.630 --> 27:20.360
President Li, this way please.

28:01.020 --> 28:03.110
This Liao Jinshan is really cunning—

28:03.130 --> 28:04.660
he kept everything so clean

28:04.970 --> 28:07.030
that there isn't a single trace left.

28:07.920 --> 28:09.350
All the staff
who handled the internal audit

28:09.350 --> 28:11.830
of Shanlifang's Chengdu headquarters
financial statements back then

28:11.830 --> 28:13.160
have already resigned.

28:30.760 --> 28:33.780
[Back-office Dumbo]
[Heading all the way west]

28:36.360 --> 28:38.000
[Moments]

28:38.020 --> 28:39.170
[Recommended: Xin You]

28:39.200 --> 28:40.550
[Back-office Dumbo
has recently followed him]

28:43.590 --> 28:44.850
Xin You (Display Name)

28:49.970 --> 28:50.840
Xin You.

28:51.980 --> 28:52.780
[Zhao De]

28:56.700 --> 28:59.200
Zhao De, help me
look up someone—Xin You.

29:28.820 --> 29:30.670
[Peach Blossom Village]

30:05.480 --> 30:06.130
Sir,

30:06.300 --> 30:08.300
do you know Xin You from your village?

30:08.300 --> 30:09.700
Xin You? Yeah, I know him.

30:09.990 --> 30:11.130
Where does he live?

30:11.790 --> 30:12.560
Just up ahead.

30:12.560 --> 30:13.480
I'm heading home anyway—

30:13.480 --> 30:14.510
you can come with me.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.200
Alright.

30:16.210 --> 30:17.010
You go first.

30:29.600 --> 30:30.640
[Peach Blossom Village]

30:33.100 --> 30:36.190
[Peach Blossom Village]

30:33.600 --> 30:34.930
This is Xin You's house.

30:36.780 --> 30:38.040
See, he's right there.

30:38.160 --> 30:38.830
Xin You!

30:39.270 --> 30:40.800
Someone's looking for you!

30:42.860 --> 30:43.400
Thank you.

30:43.400 --> 30:43.860
See you.

30:50.470 --> 30:51.430
Are you Xin You?

31:00.400 --> 31:01.860
Hello, my name is Li Yifei.

31:09.210 --> 31:11.410
Since you've already left Shanlifang,

31:11.550 --> 31:13.790
that means you no longer want
to conceal the truth for them,

31:13.790 --> 31:14.350
right?

31:14.920 --> 31:16.670
So I hope you can cooperate with us

31:16.670 --> 31:17.660
to get the accounts cleared up.

31:17.660 --> 31:21.310
That would also be the responsible thing
to do for the current group.

31:21.310 --> 31:23.110
I've seen plenty of people
from investment banking.

31:23.110 --> 31:24.920
They talk about fairness and justice,

31:24.920 --> 31:27.750
but in reality,
they're just pursuing their own goals.

31:27.750 --> 31:29.110
I will not get involved

31:29.350 --> 31:30.550
with people like you.

31:34.070 --> 31:35.880
People are different.

31:36.510 --> 31:38.440
Isn't it a bit narrow-minded

31:39.590 --> 31:41.550
to judge someone's character
based on an entire industry?

31:41.550 --> 31:42.680
Me, narrow-minded?

31:43.080 --> 31:45.360
You're all thinking about the same goal—

31:46.160 --> 31:47.760
there's no real difference.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.120
The lady in that room—

31:49.240 --> 31:51.170
she's your competitor, isn't she?

31:53.590 --> 31:55.190
She came to see me last night,

31:55.400 --> 31:57.530
and she kept pestering me all morning.

31:58.590 --> 32:01.000
I couldn't even
finish chopping my firewood.

32:01.000 --> 32:03.330
I don't have
what you're looking for here.

32:03.660 --> 32:04.520
Leave already.

32:05.030 --> 32:06.560
Don't waste your time here.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.460
I've got work to do.

32:14.200 --> 32:14.590
Jump.

32:15.590 --> 32:16.510
Qian Fei?

32:16.790 --> 32:17.270
Jump.

32:18.440 --> 32:19.640
So close… so close.

32:19.640 --> 32:20.500
Come on, again.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.310
Kill it, kill it, kill it.

32:25.310 --> 32:26.070
Hit it, hit it.

32:26.070 --> 32:27.200
Who are you hitting?

32:36.240 --> 32:38.480
Qian Fei, your acting skills
are something else.

32:38.480 --> 32:40.200
I've given you everything I know,

32:40.200 --> 32:43.060
and this is how you repay me—
just talking nonsense?

32:43.200 --> 32:45.110
I just wanted to try my luck here.

32:45.350 --> 32:47.000
With Chairman Liao's authorization,

32:47.000 --> 32:49.510
you might even
find some clues in the company.

32:49.510 --> 32:51.070
Wouldn't it make sense for us to split up
and work in parallel?

32:51.070 --> 32:52.470
Then why did you lie to me?

32:52.640 --> 32:54.330
I didn't mean to lie to you.

32:54.680 --> 32:56.180
I just wanted to rely on my own ability

32:56.180 --> 32:57.510
to get first-hand data,

32:57.790 --> 33:01.390
so I could go back to He Jing
and get Director Fang's recognition.

33:01.790 --> 33:02.440
Okay.

33:03.310 --> 33:06.070
Alright. So this is
what Fang Yun's disciple is like.

33:06.070 --> 33:07.330
Say whatever you want.

33:12.430 --> 33:16.000
So you're really willing to risk your life
just to get back to He Jing, aren't you?

33:16.000 --> 33:18.640
Maybe it's just the altitude.
Altitude sickness.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.500
Lack of oxygen.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.590
With just your abilities,

33:22.590 --> 33:25.190
do you really think
you can handle that weirdo?

33:27.510 --> 33:29.510
I've already found a breakthrough.

33:30.350 --> 33:31.030
Let me play with it for a bit.

33:31.030 --> 33:32.690
Hey, let me play with it first.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.460
Let me play with it.

33:40.270 --> 33:42.730
You dummy,
I'm not playing with you anymore.

33:57.280 --> 33:58.010
It's broken.

34:02.400 --> 34:03.130
It's broken.

34:03.150 --> 34:04.070
How old are you?

34:04.670 --> 34:05.400
It's broken.

34:07.230 --> 34:07.960
It's broken.

34:09.710 --> 34:11.110
What's going on with him?

34:11.440 --> 34:13.440
It might be Asperger's syndrome.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.880
I looked it up last night.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.010
It's broken.

34:18.880 --> 34:19.550
Uh…

34:20.320 --> 34:22.280
your iPad is broken.

34:22.440 --> 34:23.960
You should take it in for repair.

34:23.960 --> 34:25.659
I've got one just like it here—

34:25.880 --> 34:27.480
do you want to play with mine?

34:29.389 --> 34:30.120
It's broken.

34:32.400 --> 34:33.400
Isn't it the same?

34:34.670 --> 34:35.400
It's broken.

34:38.330 --> 34:40.280
What are you even going on about?
Your trick isn't working.

34:40.280 --> 34:41.000
Move. Move.

34:46.110 --> 34:48.770
Alright, stop moving around.
Come on, sit down.

34:54.150 --> 34:55.880
What's your name?

34:57.280 --> 34:58.280
Xin Ba.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.400
Like Simba

35:00.840 --> 35:01.960
from The Lion King?

35:02.400 --> 35:05.590
I'm a little boy, not a lion.

35:06.630 --> 35:09.110
Hi there, little boy Xin Ba,

35:09.400 --> 35:10.440
nice to meet you.

35:11.880 --> 35:13.670
I'm a big boy, Li Yifei.

35:13.670 --> 35:15.270
Let's get to know each other.

35:17.190 --> 35:18.400
Nice to meet you.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.190
Alright, big boy.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.710
Move left, move left.

35:27.510 --> 35:28.970
Why are you two still here?

35:30.000 --> 35:31.670
Qian Fei is playing games
with Xin Ba.

35:31.670 --> 35:33.170
They're having a really great time—
very happy,

35:33.170 --> 35:33.800
right?

35:34.190 --> 35:35.920
Come on, let's go talk outside.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.840
Don't think that just
because you try to win over my son,

35:38.840 --> 35:40.240
I'll cooperate with you.

35:43.150 --> 35:45.280
Excuse me, if you don't mind me asking—

35:45.630 --> 35:46.800
is Xin Ba

35:47.230 --> 35:48.630
on Asperger's syndrome?

35:51.000 --> 35:51.860
So what if he is?

35:52.030 --> 35:53.760
What does it have to do with you?

35:54.590 --> 35:55.070
I know

35:55.070 --> 35:55.920
children with Asperger's syndrome

35:55.920 --> 35:58.320
-need a stable environment.
-I want to play too.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.070
So you moved here to the mountains

35:59.070 --> 36:00.330
because of him, right?

36:01.920 --> 36:03.510
My son isn't sick.

36:04.110 --> 36:05.310
He's just different.

36:17.920 --> 36:18.590
Now leave.

36:19.460 --> 36:20.860
You're not welcome here.

36:49.620 --> 36:51.190
What are we supposed to do now?

36:51.190 --> 36:52.280
What else can we do?

36:52.440 --> 36:55.640
It's not like this is the first time
we've been kicked out.

36:56.400 --> 36:58.060
So we're just going back home?

36:58.440 --> 37:00.100
I'm not giving up that easily.

37:00.300 --> 37:02.500
I'm going to play the long game with him.

37:04.800 --> 37:06.320
So where are you staying tonight, then?

37:04.940 --> 37:10.480
[Peach Blossom Village]

37:08.030 --> 37:09.550
On the streets, I guess.

37:16.800 --> 37:18.860
Landlady, you're really something.

37:19.110 --> 37:20.280
How do you manage

37:20.280 --> 37:22.080
to make such good food anywhere?

37:22.360 --> 37:24.620
As your mentor, I'm truly very pleased.

37:24.640 --> 37:25.840
Impressive. Impressive.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.000
Alright, stop acting all smug.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.550
Remember to do the dishes
when you're done.

37:28.550 --> 37:29.280
Sorry. What?

37:30.430 --> 37:31.150
We're already

37:31.150 --> 37:32.300
in the closest place to heaven,

37:32.300 --> 37:34.000
and you still want me to do chores?

37:34.000 --> 37:34.440
No way.

37:40.260 --> 37:41.480
Hurry, hurry!

37:42.590 --> 37:43.430
-Yes, yes. That's right.
-What's going on?

37:43.430 --> 37:44.090
Right here.

37:44.090 --> 37:45.680
No idea. Let's go take a look.

37:45.680 --> 37:46.740
Alright, alright.

37:52.410 --> 37:54.090
Xin You, what happened?

37:54.670 --> 37:55.800
Ji is missing.

37:56.100 --> 37:57.010
-Ji?
-Ji?

37:57.600 --> 37:58.410
The kid

37:58.440 --> 37:59.420
who broke that iPad.

37:59.420 --> 38:00.610
He was probably afraid
of getting punished

38:00.610 --> 38:01.670
and ran into the mountains.

38:01.670 --> 38:02.580
He still hasn't come out.

38:02.580 --> 38:04.070
Do you need any help?

38:04.090 --> 38:04.890
We'll go look for him together.

38:04.890 --> 38:05.920
This is a mountainous area.

38:05.920 --> 38:06.940
You don't know the terrain—

38:06.940 --> 38:07.850
don't make things harder for us.

38:07.850 --> 38:09.090
Let's go look for him.

38:15.300 --> 38:16.060
Xin Ba!

38:16.330 --> 38:17.060
Xin Ba.

38:18.990 --> 38:20.240
Where are you going?

38:21.230 --> 38:23.350
I'm going to find Ji.

38:25.150 --> 38:26.710
We'll go with you, okay?

38:26.730 --> 38:28.380
Come with me first to get some gear, okay?

38:28.380 --> 38:28.930
Let's go.

38:33.740 --> 38:35.270
Do you know where Ji is?

38:36.070 --> 38:39.470
There's a place Ji often goes to,

38:39.660 --> 38:41.450
but I'm not sure.

38:42.710 --> 38:44.530
-Sneaking out in the late night...
-Over there.

38:44.530 --> 38:46.650
Aren't you afraid your dad will be angry?

38:46.650 --> 38:49.100
Ji is my friend.

38:49.510 --> 38:51.790
Friends should help each other.

38:55.030 --> 38:55.960
Be careful.

38:57.260 --> 38:58.560
Ji!

38:59.170 --> 39:00.290
Ji.

39:01.060 --> 39:02.460
Watch your step.

39:04.760 --> 39:05.590
Ji!

39:06.390 --> 39:07.660
Ji!

39:08.280 --> 39:09.150
Ji!

39:11.530 --> 39:12.650
Ji!

39:12.670 --> 39:13.810
Where are you?

39:13.840 --> 39:14.700
I'm here.

39:15.990 --> 39:17.440
Ahead—careful, careful.

39:17.440 --> 39:17.880
Okay.

39:18.400 --> 39:19.110
Where are you?

39:19.110 --> 39:19.850
Be careful, Xin Ba.

39:19.850 --> 39:21.960
I'm under this big rock.

39:22.420 --> 39:23.940
Alright, I'm coming now.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.150
-Ji!
-Ji!

39:26.150 --> 39:28.010
-Ji!
-Ji!

39:28.030 --> 39:30.080
-Ji!
-Ji!

39:30.110 --> 39:31.390
Ji!

39:31.960 --> 39:33.290
Ji!

39:33.320 --> 39:35.060
Over here! Over here! Over here!

39:35.060 --> 39:36.940
Ji! Ji! Ji!

39:36.970 --> 39:37.700
Come here.

39:37.730 --> 39:38.340
Ji!

39:39.040 --> 39:39.720
Be careful.

39:39.760 --> 39:40.430
Be careful.

39:40.450 --> 39:41.520
Here. We found him.

39:41.540 --> 39:42.290
We found him.

39:44.330 --> 39:45.270
Is the child okay?

39:45.270 --> 39:46.480
Ji, are you alright?

39:46.510 --> 39:47.600
-Thank you.
-Are you okay?

39:47.600 --> 39:49.670
-Thank you so much!
-Thank you so much!

39:49.670 --> 39:50.840
-Thank you so much! Thank you so much!

39:50.840 --> 39:51.670
Thank you.

39:52.210 --> 39:53.410
We finally found him.

39:53.410 --> 39:54.360
Alright, we're leaving.

39:54.360 --> 39:55.080
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

39:55.080 --> 39:55.470
Okay.

39:55.490 --> 39:56.220
Are you okay?

39:57.610 --> 39:58.610
Come home with me.

40:02.010 --> 40:02.660
Xin You,

40:06.760 --> 40:08.190
be a little gentler with the child.

40:08.190 --> 40:09.790
Why are you always so strict?

40:11.170 --> 40:12.500
This is a friend of mine,

40:12.760 --> 40:13.900
and here's his website.

40:13.900 --> 40:16.390
He's a world-renowned

40:16.550 --> 40:17.770
autism specialist

40:20.290 --> 40:22.770
who focuses specifically

40:22.790 --> 40:24.560
on treatment and training
for this condition.

40:24.560 --> 40:26.230
If you truly care about Xin Ba,

40:26.990 --> 40:27.890
I believe

40:28.430 --> 40:29.910
you know what's best.

40:34.380 --> 40:34.870
Right?

40:38.480 --> 40:39.000
Go back.

40:43.710 --> 40:44.240
Let's go.

40:48.430 --> 40:49.350
Good job.

41:09.580 --> 41:10.510
Where are we now?

41:14.570 --> 41:16.710
It still says 5 hours and 2 minutes?

41:15.350 --> 41:16.520
[251 km 5 hours 2 minutes]

41:17.030 --> 41:19.320
It wasn't this long on the map before.

41:19.800 --> 41:21.130
This is a mountain road.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.350
So by the time we get there,

41:23.350 --> 41:25.010
won't it already be daylight?

41:25.840 --> 41:26.770
Then just sleep.

41:27.690 --> 41:28.960
I'd better keep you company for a bit.

41:28.960 --> 41:29.940
Otherwise you'll fall asleep

41:29.940 --> 41:31.340
and both of us are doomed.

41:31.690 --> 41:33.310
As if I would—

41:33.720 --> 41:34.650
I'm not going to.

41:39.220 --> 41:40.990
It's so dark outside...

41:41.480 --> 41:44.210
You can't even see your hand
in front of your face.

41:47.240 --> 41:47.990
Landlady,

41:50.660 --> 41:52.060
are you scared of ghosts?

41:53.840 --> 41:55.150
Of course not.

41:55.170 --> 41:55.950
T-There's

41:56.000 --> 41:58.060
no such thing as ghosts in this world.

42:00.030 --> 42:01.840
But I've heard people say that

42:03.150 --> 42:04.810
when you're driving at night—

42:04.920 --> 42:06.720
especially in places like this—

42:07.440 --> 42:09.150
you often see people

42:09.150 --> 42:11.070
in white trying to stop vehicles.

42:12.030 --> 42:12.960
And if the driver

42:13.230 --> 42:15.640
is kind enough to let them in,

42:16.360 --> 42:17.230
after a while...

42:17.230 --> 42:18.350
Guess what?

42:18.960 --> 42:20.690
The temperature in the vehicle

42:21.280 --> 42:22.360
drops lower

42:23.280 --> 42:24.280
and lower.

42:26.770 --> 42:28.690
A cold draft starts blowing,

42:30.510 --> 42:32.590
and suddenly it drops
more than 10 degrees.

42:32.590 --> 42:33.660
You know what?

42:33.960 --> 42:36.370
Then the windows

42:36.840 --> 42:38.130
start fogging up,

42:38.630 --> 42:41.230
and your vision
gets blurrier and blurrier...

42:44.580 --> 42:45.380
Look—

42:45.610 --> 42:47.160
isn't there someone in white?

42:47.160 --> 42:49.070
I don't know if there's someone
in white outside,

42:49.070 --> 42:51.270
but there is someone in white in the car.

42:52.050 --> 42:53.580
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.150 --> 42:55.800
Hey, Yu, you called me?

42:55.800 --> 42:56.660
I just woke up.

42:56.890 --> 42:58.970
Wow, I can't believe you were sleeping.

42:58.970 --> 43:00.710
HR couldn't reach you,

43:00.710 --> 43:02.170
so they called me instead.

43:02.980 --> 43:04.790
Were you in Chengdu a while ago?

43:04.820 --> 43:07.330
You really do keep track
of my movements, don't you?

43:07.330 --> 43:08.140
So,

43:08.760 --> 43:10.160
how was the Chengdu trip?

43:10.570 --> 43:12.510
The investigation report—

43:13.630 --> 43:15.360
you already have it, don't you?

43:17.380 --> 43:18.510
Hello, Uncle Jiang.

43:19.760 --> 43:20.480
What?
